check if the pi is on and resonding:
    ping pi@raspberrypi.local

ssh into the pi
    ssh pi@raspberrypi.local

    Improved for maintaining contact with ht epie for an extended period:
        ssh -o ServerAliveInterval=60 -o ServerAliveCountMax=5 pi@raspberrypi.local

view interface addresses:
    arp -a



pulling the branch
    //navigate to directory
    git pull origin 'BranchName'
        //will need Username and Key

To run the file
    python3 'fileName'

Running in a 3.10 python virtual environment
    cd 'go to repo destination'
    python3.10 -m venv venv
    source venv/bin/activate

    can install libraries needed using pip
    run like normal, from within the venv environment

    to exit
        deactivate
    to re-enter
        cd to location
        source venv/bin/activate